OL,3,GNEWSAEssex town becomes first to twin
OL,4,Awith Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe town of Burnham-on-Crouch has
OL,7,Fbecome the first in Essex to be twinned
OL,8,Fwith a Ukrainian settlement.
OL,10,FIt was paired with Yaremche, located in
OL,11,Fwestern Ukraine, after town councillor
OL,12,FStephen Stratton spent six months
OL,13,Fvolunteering in the country.
OL,15,FDignitaries hoped the relationship
OL,16,Fwould help to forge stronger cultural
OL,17,Fand economic ties, while also offering
OL,18,Fsolidarity to those affected by the
OL,19,Fconflict.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
