OL,3,GNEWSAEssex town becomes first to twin
OL,4,Awith Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnna Antonenko, who left Kyiv for
OL,7,FMaldon after Russia's full-scale
OL,8,Finvasion of her country in 2022, said
OL,9,Fshe was "so happy" about the
OL,10,Fpartnership.
